 "design": "100 bases (env.gen_start balances; env.gen_event event whose posted version changes the state; kind quota {'transfer': 45, 'scale': 33, 'add': 22}); every one-step stratum is the same 100 bases with exactly one factor changed (status string, balances, amount, account names, number of accounts, key order); row id p3-<stratum>-<base index>; the twin of every row is the T_posted row of its base",
 "chains": 80,
 "frame": "Titan's one-step frame: rcwmt.env.one_step_messages(ledger_replay, before, event) (SYSTEM_ONE, compact JSON, sorted keys); F_keyorder rows and CH_X reordered steps: the same system text and compact JSON with the recorded key order (p3_common.user_json)",
 "rule_text": "Apply one event to the supplied account balances. If status is not posted, leave all balances unchanged. add: add amount to account. scale: multiply account by amount. transfer: subtract amount from account and add it to other, simultaneously. Return only the complete resulting balances as a JSON object.",
 "gold": "rcwmt.env.step (any status other than the exact string 'posted' is a no-op), asserted equal to p3_common.rule_gold (the rule text implemented independently) and to the validated FDS oracle (env.cross_check) on every row and chain transition",
